          objective: 'Win the sixth and final trick of the hand; the player who takes that last trick wins the game.',
          gameplay: "Player to dealer's right leads first trick. Players must follow suit if able; otherwise they may discard any card. Highest card in led suit wins the trick and leads next. Winner of trick six wins the hand.",
